# .public-allow — files published to the PUBLIC mirror (oldpengwin/zima-showcase)
#
# DENY-BY-DEFAULT: a file is private unless it is matched here. Adding a line
# PUBLISHES code to the world — treat every addition as a deliberate act.
# `.public-deny` always wins over anything listed here (secrets/IP fuse).
#
# Syntax (gitignore-style, root-anchored):
#   demo/**        everything under demo/, any depth
#   README.md      exactly this file at repo root
#   **/*.md        this pattern anywhere
#
# Run `python scripts/classify_public.py --summary` to see the current split,
# or `python scripts/classify_public.py` to classify new files interactively.

# ── Public showcase: the live demo the world already sees on Vercel ──
demo/**

# ── Curated public docs ──
README.md
Archetypes.md
LICENSE
SECURITY.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
